      "sourceTextSha256": "33c7876339f838928c228eb09ffbc8987821eb7c05e33c5d6b88c3b9b0607002",
      "text": "Day 9 · Transfer to the airport and flight to Rio de Janeiro, where our guide meets you for the transfer to your hotel in Búzios. A former fishing village about 170 km (105 miles) from Rio, Búzios has more than 20 magnificent beaches and crystal-clear water, beautiful landscapes, exotic vegetation and summer weather almost all year round. It has grown into a picturesque town, famous for its blend of rustic charm, architectural harmony and natural beauty, with sophisticated boutiques and restaurants that welcome travellers from all over the world.",
